    {
      "key": "request-output-count",
      "domain": "vllm-output-processing",
      "recall_target": "按每次调用的交付列表统计FINAL_ONLY输出数量",
      "assessment": "discrimination",
      "layer": "atomic",
      "fact_scope": {
        "kind": "snapshot",
        "product": "vllm",
        "version": "v0.26.0",
        "commit": "568afb3a13806beb53bb2e6bd518269357b237c0"
      },
      "quality": "A",
      "fact_status": "verified",
      "lifecycle": "active",
      "priority": 5,
      "template_id": "correction",
      "fields": {
        "意图": "连续三次 process_outputs，如何统计每次可交付结果数？",
        "场景": "vLLM v0.26.0；单请求 FINAL_ONLY，无 queue：未结束 → 前端命中 stop → 迟到输出。P1-05",
        "正确": "本题每次可交付结果数是 0、1、0；统计的是 len(request_outputs)。",
        "错误": "我把三次 request_outputs 数量填写为 1 → 2 → 2。",
        "说明": {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "lead",
              "parts": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "request_outputs 是本次可交付结果列表，每次调用重新建立。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "point",
              "label": "过滤",
              "parts": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "FINAL_ONLY 未结束时不生成 RequestOutput；处理输入不等于新增可交付结果。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "boundary",
              "parts": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "无结果为 []；外层结果对象、输入数量和列表长度不是同一概念。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "content_summary": "按每次调用的交付列表统计FINAL_ONLY输出数量",
      "depends_on": [],
      "rank": 5,
      "source_ids": [
        "p1-structured-log"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "exclude-stop-text",
      "domain": "vllm-output-processing",
      "recall_target": "确定排除stop字符串时的最终文本截断位置",
      "assessment": "discrimination",
      "layer": "atomic",
      "fact_scope": {
        "kind": "snapshot",
        "product": "vllm",
        "version": "v0.26.0",
        "commit": "568afb3a13806beb53bb2e6bd518269357b237c0"
      },
      "quality": "A",
      "fact_status": "verified",
      "lifecycle": "active",
      "priority": 5,
      "template_id": "correction",
      "fields": {
        "意图": "include_stop_str_in_output=False 时，文本截到 stop 的哪里？",
        "场景": "vLLM v0.26.0；文本 The river is quiet today.，stop 为 is quiet。P1-06",
        "正确": "截到 stop 起点；本例为 \"The river \"，末尾保留一个空格。",
        "错误": "我预测最终文本为 The river is quiet，仍保留了 stop。",
        "说明": {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "lead",
              "parts": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "排除选项会去掉 stop 字符串及其后的文本。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "point",
              "label": "对照",
              "parts": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "保留 stop 时截到它的末尾，而不是保留后续整批文本。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "boundary",
              "parts": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "结论针对文本 stop string，不把它混同于所有 token 终止情形。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "content_summary": "确定排除stop字符串时的最终文本截断位置",
      "depends_on": [],
      "rank": 6,
      "source_ids": [
        "p1-structured-log"
      ]
    },
